3. billion-context - MIT License with Additional Attribution Term
==============================================================================

Copyright (c) 2026 ranxianglei

SeekGo includes a functionally ported, simplified implementation of the
long-context compression idea from billion-context: automatic summarization
of older conversation rounds, summary-based context injection, and the
ability to view or clear the compressed context. SeekGo's in-app analysis
panel also adapts billion-context's token, compression-block, cache, and
cost analysis ideas. The original project is a local proxy that rewrites
Anthropic/OpenAI streams and injects
compress/decompress/search_context/acp_status tools; that proxy, acp-kernel,
and its multi-client integrations are not included.

Attribution (required by the Additional Term of the license):

  This product uses a functional port of billion-context, a context
  compression plugin by ranxianglei.
  https://github.com/ranxianglei/billion-context

Original project: https://github.com/ranxianglei/billion-context
License text and Additional Term: licenses/billion-context-LICENSE.txt

